{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53027","headline":"经罗渊吊屈原 · 张翔","name":"经罗渊吊屈原","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"谠言忠谏阻春霄，放逐南荒泽国遥。\n五梦楚兰香易染，一魂香水渺难招。\n风声落日心逾壮，鱼腹终天恨未消。\n却借微香荐苹藻，海门何处问渔樵？\n（光绪《湘阴县图志》卷四。\n此诗及张翔事迹，皆从陶敏先生所告）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张翔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53027.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53027","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}